<div class="item-list-part-description wysiwyg-wrapper">
<h2 class="small-title">B2B Web Development Features</h2>
<p class="sub-title">B2B Websites
                  <span class="highlight">Built for Leads, Content and Growth</span>
</p>
<p>A B2B website needs a solid technical foundation that supports your sales and marketing teams while
                  remaining practical to manage over time.
                  It should be easy for your team to update, straightforward for buyers to use and flexible enough to
                  accommodate new services, campaigns, resources, integrations and enquiry pathways as your business
                  develops.
                  At Orcanex, we focus on clean development, practical CMS controls and performance from the beginning,
                  creating a website that can support your business today without making future updates unnecessarily
                  difficult.

                </p>
</div>
