<div class="item-content wysiwyg-wrapper">
<h3 class="h5-style">Frontend rebuilds with cleaner polish</h3>
<p class="p2">We bring the redesign to life with clean, responsive frontend development. Layouts,
                      forms, animations, menus and CTAS are built to feel smooth and reliable across devices.</p>
</div>
