<div class="item-list-part-description wysiwyg-wrapper">
<h2 class="small-title">Responsive Web Development Features</h2>
<p class="sub-title">Responsive web design <span class="highlight">built for speed, stability &amp;
                    control</span></p>
<p>A responsive website needs clean development behind the design. It should load smoothly, behave
                  reliably and give your team flexible control without breaking the experience across screen sizes. We
                  build responsive websites with careful front-end structure, practical CMS control, performance
                  optimisation and testing that protects the user experience across devices.</p>
</div>
