<img alt="BoA Feature" class="full-width-image" data-src="https://www.chromatix.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Frame-7-3.png" data-srcset="https://www.chromatix.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Frame-7-3-600x440.png 600w, https://www.chromatix.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Frame-7-3-768x564.png 768w, https://www.chromatix.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Frame-7-3-100x73.png 100w, https://www.chromatix.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Frame-7-3-270x198.png 270w, https://www.chromatix.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Frame-7-3.png 1078w" height="791" title="BoA Feature" width="1078"/>
