<div class="item-content wysiwyg-wrapper">
<h3 class="h5-style">Add-to-cart moments that feel easy</h3>
<p>Every Shopify interface choice has a job. Add-to-cart buttons, variant selectors, cart drawers,
                      payment cues, bundles and upsells are designed to reduce effort and make the buying path feel
                      obvious.</p>
</div>
