<div class="item-content wysiwyg-wrapper">
<h3 class="h5-style">Mobile shopping with fewer taps</h3>
<p>Mobile shoppers are impatient, practical and often ready to compare. We design Shopify mobile
                      experiences with thumb-friendly actions, quick product scanning, sticky purchase prompts and
                      cleaner checkout moments.</p>
</div>
