<div class="item-content wysiwyg-wrapper">
<h3 class="h5-style">Responsive trade experience</h3>
<p>Your buyers may be ordering from an office, warehouse, job site or while travelling between
                      meetings. We design responsive B2B eCommerce experiences that keep product details, account tools,
                      forms and CTAs easy to use across every screen.</p>
</div>
