<div class="item-content wysiwyg-wrapper">
<h3 class="h5-style">100% sales-focused layout</h3>
<p>Not every B2B purchase goes straight to checkout. We create layouts that support both online
                      orders and sales-led enquiries, making it easy for buyers to request quotes, ask questions, check
                      options or move towards purchase when they are ready.</p>
</div>
