<div class="item-list-part-description wysiwyg-wrapper">
<h2 class="small-title">B2B eCommerce Web Development Features</h2>
<p class="sub-title">Custom B2B <span class="highlight">development for serious stores</span></p>
<p>B2B eCommerce development has to do more than make a store work. It needs to support
                  customer-specific pricing, account access, product data, integrations, approvals, quotes, stock
                  visibility and sales workflows without making the experience feel heavy. We build the technical
                  structure that <strong>helps buyers move</strong> faster, teams reduce manual handling and your
                  website become a more capable part of the business.</p>
</div>
