<div class="item-content wysiwyg-wrapper"><h3 class="h4-style">Search &amp; filters that reduce effort</h3>
<p>Strong search and filtering helps customers move from broad interest to the right product faster. We shape filter labels, product attributes, sorting behaviour and search pathways around real shopper intent.</p>
</div>
