<div class="item-content wysiwyg-wrapper"><h3 class="h4-style">Testing notes for key journeys</h3>
<p>We map important journeys before your eCommerce shop’s launch or rollout. That includes product discovery, search, filters, product selection, add-to-cart behaviour, discount use, checkout and confirmation flow.</p>
</div>
