<div class="item-list-part-description wysiwyg-wrapper">
<h2 class="small-title">Web Application Design Features</h2>
<p class="sub-title">Web application design <span class="highlight">built for real users</span></p>
<p>A strong web application should make complicated actions feel calm, clear and manageable. Users need
                  to understand where they are, what needs attention, what action comes next and how to complete the
                  task without confusion. We design web app experiences that turn business logic into user-friendly
                  digital flow, with every screen shaped around practical use.</p>
</div>
